Uitvoer skryf: ['txt does not equal Word Salad = '] + ( txt ≠ ['Word Salad'] ), nuwe-reël.
Uitvoer skryf: ['txt does not equal Ceasar Salad = '] + ( txt ≠ ['Ceasar Salad'] ), nuwe-reël.

